All,
There are certain considerations that must be taken into account when molde=
d HDPE fittings manufactured by others are sold by Harco.  This blurt addre=
sses Nupi and Strongbridge specifically.

Nupi and Strongbridge are based overseas but promote their product through =
the websites nupiamericas.com & strongbridge.us.  One of their online resou=
rces is a library of dimensional drawings and data-sheets.  These data-shee=
ts recite pressure ratings based on European ISO standards and not American=
 ASTM standards.  Pressure rating is calculated differently between these s=
ets of standards.  For example, Nupi data-sheets describe DR11 as 230 psi w=
hile by American convention DR11 is 200psi.  .  Harco sells to a North Amer=
ican market and is governed by the ASTM calculations.

We have requested they revise their data sheets to reflect American pressur=
e ratings.

Customer service and sales staff should not recite the pressure ratings lis=
ted on Nupi or Strongbridge data-sheets and should not provide those data-s=
heets to customers.  If a drawing/data-sheet of these products is required,=
 please request one be produced through the channels you typically make suc=
h requests and it will be created on a Harco template.


--_000_0fe54f9263ae4d18ac592e7f104c1382harcofittingscom_
